has been doing all the heavy lifting as of late,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_6","text":"and now you're telling me there's more to deal with?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_7","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_8","text":"The item on today's agenda pertains to the issue of resource depletion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_9","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_10","text":"Are you pulling my leg?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_11","text":"The Ark has been in the red from the moment it was built.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_12","text":"Has there ever been a time when our resources weren't depleted?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_13","text":"... Enikk, could you provide some additional information, please?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_14","text":"Certainly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_15","text":"During the past year, several incidents both inside and outside the Ark have resulted in unforeseen amounts of damage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_16","text":"Approximately 47% of our resource reserves were expended to ameliorate these damages.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_17","text":"Until recently, this shortfall has been covered through the use of mass-produced mining units.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_18","text":"The reserves at these mines, however, have been gradually depleting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_19","text":"The mining units have had to move to increasingly more dangerous areas in search of new mines,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_20","text":"and this has dramatically reduced their survival rate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_21","text":"As a result, the Ark is operating at a deficit in nearly every area: minerals, energy, food, etc.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_22","text":"There is a paucity of nearly every resource, and output is far behind citizens' demand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_23","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_24","text":"I knew this day would come,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_25","text":"but not this soon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_26","text":"If this trend continues unabated,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_27","text":"a major economic depression will occur within 3 years","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_28","text":"due to soaring prices of food and other raw materials.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_29","text":"Should that state of affairs last for 10 years or more,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_30","text":"the Ark will no longer be capable of supporting its current population.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_31","text":"Around 32% of its citizens will be forced to relocate to the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_32","text":"Non. We cannot have that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_33","text":"The Outer Rim is already overfilled as is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_34","text":"If any more personnel are added to it, it will become a power keg that could go off at any moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_35","text":"I don't see why we're making this so complicated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_36","text":"What's the problem? We've just gotta find a new mining location, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_37","text":"I've got your solution. I'll send out Matis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_38","text":"Don't be a fool.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_39","text":"Even if you do find something, the entire point is that it will almost certainly be in a dangerous area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_40","text":"Are you planning on having Matis stationed there permanently?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_41","text":"Of course not, why would I?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_42","text":"Matis are heroes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_43","text":"Why waste perfectly good heroes by letting them rot out in the wastelands?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_44","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_45","text":"Are there any other options?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_46","text":"... I-I have an idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_bluewaterisland_prologue_47","text":"According to records from the first invasion,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_bluewaterisland_prologue_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_Su